        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isarela wanyamukili nayuma yindi yejima, washi kili kuBerisheba, wamuketwilili Nzambi yatata yindi Isaka yimuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wahosheli naYakoba kuyimwenu yawufuku, nindi, Yakoba, Yakoba. Yena nindi, Vude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Yami Nzambi, Nzambi yatata yeyi. Bayi wutiyawoma kuya muEjipituku, kwenoku nakakwilisha muchidi weneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami nakaya neyi muEjipitu, ami nawa nakakuleta cheŋi chalala. Yosefu wakakukwatachikasa chindi hamesu eyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba wanyamukili kuBerisheba. Anyana kaIsarela asendeli tata yawu Yakoba, ni anyanawu anyanya, ni aŋodi jawu, mumatemba atemesheliyi Fwaro kulonda kumusendelamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayili niyimuna yawu, niyuma yawu, yaheteluwu mwituŋa daKenani, hiyakushika muEjipitu, Yakoba ni anyanindi ejima hamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wowu anyanindi amayala, niezukulu indi amayala hamu, ni anyanindi awambanda, niezukulu indi awambanda, anyanindi ejima wayili nawu muEjipitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu majina awanyana kaIsarela ayili muEjipitu, aYakoba nawanyanindi amayala; iwu Rubeni, wedi waYakoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaRubeni amayala; iwu Hanoki, iwu Palu, iwu Hezeroni, iwu Karami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyanaka Simeyona amayala; iwu Yemuweli, iwu Yamini, iwu Ohadi, iwu Yakini, iwu Zohari, iwu Shawulu mwana kamumbanda wamuKenani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaLevi amayala; iwu Gerishoni, iwu Kohati, iwu Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaYuda amayala; iwu Eri, iwu Onani, iwu Shela, iwu Perezi, iwu Zera. Ilaŋa Eri naOnani afwilili mwituŋa daKenani. Anyana kaPerezi amayala adiŋi iwu Hezeroni, iwu Hamuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsakari amayala; iwu Tola, iwu Puva, iwu Yoba, iwu Shimironi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaZebuluni amayala; iwu Seredi, iwu Eloni, iwu Yaheleyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa diwu anyana kaLeya amayala, amuvweleliyi Yakoba muPadani Arama, hamu namwanindi wamumbanda Dina; antu ejima anyanindi, ni amayala niambanda, adiŋi makumi asatu nasatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaGadi amayala; iwu Zifwiyoni, iwu Haŋi, iwu Shuni, iwu Eziboni, iwu Eri, iwu Arodi, iwu Areli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaAsheri amayala; iwu Imina, iwu Ishiva, iwu Ishivi, iwu Beriya, nimuhelawu Sera. Anyana kaBeriya amayala, iwu Heberi, iwu Malikiyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa diwu anyana amayala avweliyi Zilipa enkeliyi Labani mwanindi Leya, wenawa diwuamuvweleleliyi Yakoba, antu ikumi natanu nawumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana amayala avweliyi Racheli iŋoda Yakoba; iwu Yosefu, iwu Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi Yosefu kwituŋa daEjipitu kwavwalikili niManaseni Efweremi, diwu amuvweleleliyi Asenati mwana kaPoti Fwenaa, chikombeji chaOni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaBenjamini amayala; iwu Bela, iwu Bekeri, iwu Ashibeli, iwu Gera, iwu Nayamani, iwu Ehi, iwu Roshi, iwu Mupimi, iwu Hupimi, iwu Aradi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa diwu anyana kaRacheli amayala avwalikili kudi Yakoba, antu ejima ikumi nawana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaDani amayala; Hushimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaNafwatali amayala; iwu Yahazeyeli, iwu Guni, iwu Yezeri, iwu Shilemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenawa diwu anyana amayala avweliyi Biliha enkeliyi Labani mwanindi Racheli, diwu amuvweleleliyi Yakoba, antu ejima atanu nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejima ayili naYakoba muEjipitu, afumini mumayindi, kubombani aŋodi jawanyana kaYakoba, antu ejima adiŋi makumi atanu nadimunatanu nawumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaYosefu, avwalikili kudi yena muEjipitu, adiŋi antu ayedi. Antu ejima akumutaŋa waYakoba ayili muEjipitu adiŋi makumi atanu namakumi ayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watemeshelaŋahu dehi Yuda kudi Yosefu kulonda akalomboli njilayakuya kuGosheni, ashika nikushika mwituŋa daGosheni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu waloŋesheli ikalu dindi, wayili nakukinkilila tata yindi Isarela kuGosheni. Wadishikŋili kudi yena, wamunoŋaminini hanshiŋu yindi, nakudila hanshiŋu yindi, dile-e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isarela wamwilili Yosefu, nindi, Ichidinu chinakumoni kumesu eyi chiwuchidi mumi, nidifwili tuhu kwami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
